# "Add {U} for each artifact you control": with no artifact the Academy adds nothing (and is tapped). On turn 3 Bot1 controls an Ornithopter (an artifact creature), Mox Pearl and a Clue token (an artifact token) and so taps it for {U}{U}{U}, while
# Bot2's Mox Jet, Thraben Inspector (not an artifact) and the Academy itself (a land) do not count.

[Bot1 Deck]
Tolarian Academy
Ornithopter
Mox Pearl
Thraben Inspector
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Jet
Island x16

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Tolarian Academy.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Tolarian Academy.Activate
? Bot1.Mana =
? Bot1.Battlefield.Tolarian Academy.Tapped = true
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Thraben Inspector.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Tolarian Academy.Activate
? Bot1.Mana = {U}{U}{U}

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Tolarian Academy.Tapped = true
